#ASSERT `the SC page excludes` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 7349)
#ASSERT `the SC page excludes` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 7511)
#ASSERT `the SC page excludes` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 7523)
