-- Named accounts.
#ASSERT `the SC page excludes` (`purchase described as` `the base purchase` `EZ-Link`)
#ASSERT `the SC page excludes` (`purchase described as` `the base purchase` `FlashPay`)
#ASSERT `the SC page excludes` (`purchase described as` `the base purchase` `Transit Link`)
#ASSERT `the SC page excludes` (`purchase described as` `the base purchase` `TRANSIT`)
