#ASSERT NOT (`the SC page excludes` (`purchase described as` `the base purchase` `Amaze`))

-- The SIMPLYGO entry is the open reading, not an exclusion.
#ASSERT NOT (`the SC page excludes` (`purchase described as` `the base purchase` `SimplyGo as a descriptor`))
#ASSERT `only the SIMPLYGO entry would exclude` (`purchase described as` `the base purchase` `SimplyGo as a descriptor`)
#ASSERT NOT (`only the SIMPLYGO entry would exclude` `the base purchase`)
